{"id":"word:hebrew:H7965","type":"word","title":"שָׁלוֹם","subtitle":"H7965 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"safe , i.e. (figuratively) well , happy , friendly ; also (abstractly) welfare , i.e. health, prosperity, peace","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to שָׁלוֹם (H7965) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-m.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 237 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"שָׁלוֹם (shâlôwm) means safe , i.e. (figuratively) well , happy , friendly ; also (abstractly) welfare , i.e. health, prosperity, peace First listed occurrence: 1Chr 12 18."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"שָׁלוֹם","transliteration":"shâlôwm","pronunciation":"shaw-lome'","strong":"H7965","lemmaId":"hebrew:H7965","partOfSpeech":"n-m","forms":["שָׁלֽוֹם","שָׁל֔וֹם","שָׁל֖וֹם","שָׁל֣וֹם","שָׁל֑וֹם"],"morphs":[["HNcmsa",116],["HR/Ncmsa",62],["HTi/Ncmsa",14],["HNcmsc",10],["HC/Ncmsa",5],["HC/R/Ncmsa",4],["HTd/Ncmsa",4],["HNcmsc/Sp1cs",4],["HNcmsc/Sp2ms",3],["HR/Ncmsc",2]]},"definitions":{"short":"safe , i.e. (figuratively) well , happy , friendly ; also (abstractly) welfare , i.e. health, prosperity, peace","usage":"× do, familiar, × fare, favour, friend, × great, (good) health, (× perfect, such as be at) peace(-able, -ably), prosper(-ity, -ous), rest, safe(-ty), salute, welfare, (× all is, be) well, × wholly.","full":"H7965. shalom שָׁלוֺם 237 noun masculine Isa 54:13 completeness, soundness, welfare, peace (Lag BN 174 ); — ׳שׁ Gen 29:6 +; שָׁלֹם (rare) Ezek 13:16 +; construct שְׁלוֺם Gen 37:14 +; suffix שְׁלוֺמִי Psa 41:10 +, etc.; plural (all dubious) שְׁלוֺמִים Jer 13:19 ; Psa 69:23 ; suffix שְׁמָֹיו 55:21 ; &#8212; 1 completeness in number, שְׁלוֺמִים הָגְלָת Jer 13:19 Judah is wholly carried captive (but read שְׁלֵמָה גָּלוּת , compare Amos 1:6 ; so ᵐ5 We Amos SS Buhl). 2 safety, soundness , in body, בַּעֲצָמַי שָׁלוֺם אֵין Psa 38:4 ; לְשָׁלוֺם Isa 38:17 ; אָהֳלֶ֑ךָ שָׁלוֺם (Ges § 141c ) Job 5:24 is safe, secure. 3 welfare, health, prosperity: לפ ׳שָׁאַל ׳לשׁ ask one about welfare Gen 43:27 (J), Exod 18:7 (E), Judg 18:15 7 t., compare 2Sam 11:7 (3 t. in verse); pregnantly לשׁלום ירד 2Kin 10:13 descend (to ask) about welfare of, compare 1Sam 17:18 ; Jer 38:4 ; לשׁ ׳הלד Exod 4:18 (E) + 5 t.; לשׁ ׳עלה Gen 44:17 (J), 1Sam 25:35 ; לשׁ ׳דבּר Gen 37:4 (JE); ל ׳שָׁלוֺם be well with 29:6 ; 43:23 , 28 (J), Judg 6:23 ; 19:20 ; 1Sam 20:7 , 21 10 t., 2Kin 4:26 (3 t. in verse); בְּ שָׁלוֺם Psa 122:7 ; 122:8 may it be well in ; absolute as object of אָמַר well, be well , ׳שׁ Gen 29:6 (J), 2Sam 18:28 ; 2Kin 9:11 , 17 , 18 , 19 , 22 ; Jer 6:14 (twice in verse) + 10 t.; אֲבִיכֶם הֲשָׁלוֺם (Ges § 141c ) Gen 43:27 (J); ׳שׁ בּ(וֺ)אֶ֑ךָ 1Sam 16:4 (see Dr), 1Kin 2:13 ; שׁ ׳אֵין Jer 6:14 3 t.; שׁ ׳אין לרשׁעים Isa 48:22 ; 57:21 ; but ׳שׁ רשׁעים ראה Psa 73:3 ; שׁ ׳רֹב 37:11 ; 72:7 ; שׁ ׳שׁאל ׳פ 122:6 ; שׁ ׳דרשׁ (|| טוב ) Deut 23:7 ; Ezra 9:12 ; ׳שׁ לָךְ יוֺסִיפוּ Prov 3:2 ; ׳בַּשׁ Job 15:21 in time of prosperity. 4 peace, quiet, tranquility, contentment , Isa 32:17 (|| הַשְׁקֵט וָבֶטַח ); בשׁ ׳שָׁכַב Psalm 4:9 (to sleep); depart life ׳בְּשׁ in tranquillity Gen 15:15 (R JE ), 1Kin 2:6 3 t., יְבוֺא Isa 57:2 ; שׁ לְאִישׁ ׳אַחֲרִית Psa 37:37 ; בשׁ ׳בא Exod 18:23 (E) come in contentment ; שׁ ׳ארץ Jer 12:5 ; שׁ ׳נְוֵה (|| מבטחים ) Isa 32:18 , compare Jer 25:37 ; ׳שׁ מִמָּ֑חַד Job 21:9 ; לְמקֵשׁ ולשׁלומים Psa 69:23 security , (let it) become a trap (but ᵐ5 Aq Symm Theod Jerome וּלְמ ׳וּלְשִׁלּוּמִים , Du (compare ᵑ7 ) וּשְׁלָמִים peace-offerings , and שֻׁלְחָן v a ). 5 peace, friendship: a. human relations: שְׁמִֹי אֱנוֺשׁ Jer 20:10 man of my friendship , compare 38:22 ; Obadiah 7; Psa 41:10 ; שׁ ׳עֲצַת בין Zech 6:13 ; שׁ ׳יֹעֲצֵי Prov 12:20 ; ( עִם אֵת, ) שׁ ׳דבּר Psa 28:3 ; 35:20 ; Jer 9:7 ; שׁ ׳בקּשׁ Psa 34:15 ; שׁ ׳ידע Isa 59:8 ; שׁ ׳דֶּרֶךְ 59:8 ; ׳בשׁ שׁלּח Gen 26:29 (J); בשׁ ׳הלן 26:31 (J), 1Sam 29:7 4 t.; בשׁ ׳שׁוב 2Sam 15:27 ; || צדקה in Messianic reign Psa 72:3 . b. peace with God, especially in covenant relation: Isa 54:10 ברית covt. of my peace , compare Num 25:12 (P), Ezek 34:25 ; 37:26 , also Mal 2:5 ; ׳י ׳שׁ as name of altar Judg 6:24 ; ׳י subject שׁ ׳שׁם לְ Num 6:26 (P); בשׁ ׳בֵּרַךְ Psa 29:11 ; שׁ ׳חפץ 35:27 ; שׁ ׳עשׂה לְ Jer 33:9 ; שׁ אָסַף ׳מֵאֵת 16:5 (|| חסד ); שׁ ׳דבּר אֶל Psa 85:9 ; שׁ ׳נתן Hag 2:9 ; שׁ ׳מחשׁבות Jer 29:11 ; man subject שׁ ׳עשׂח ׳ל Isa 27:5 (twice in verse); בשׁ ׳הלן Mal 2:6 . In this sense || אֶדֶק Psa 85:11 , || אְדָקָה Isa 54:13 ; 60:17 , || שִׂמְחָה 55:12 , is like a river 48:18 ; 66:12 ; עַליֿשׂראל׳שׁ Psa 125:5 ; 128:6 , שׁ דוֺרָדֶ֑ךָ לְאֹהֲבֵי ׳רָב 119:165 ; שׁ ׳מוּסַר Isa 53:5 chastisement for our peace (but SS Buhl שִׁלֻּמֵינוּ ). 6 peace from war: ( ל ) שׁ ׳עשׂה make peace (with) Josh 9:15 ; Job 25:2 ; שׁ ׳נתן בארץ Lev 26:6 (H); שׁ ׳ובין בין Judg 4:17 ; 1Sam 7:14 ; 1 Kings 5:26; (ל)שׁ ׳קרא Deut 20:10 ; Judg 21:13 ; Micah 3:5 ; בשׁ ׳שׁוב Josh 10:21 (E), Judg 8:9 ; 11:31 ; בשׁ ׳בא 2Sam 19:25 ; 19:31 7 t.; שׁ ׳היה לְ 1Kin 5:4 3 t., compare 2Sam 17:3 (see Dr); שׁ ׳בקּשׁ Ezek 7:25 ; שׁ ׳מלאכי Isa 33:7 ; שׁ ׳נתן רָשֶׁקֶט 1Chr 22:9 ; שׁ ׳מוֺצְאֵת Song 8:10 ; ׳שׁ (ו)אמת Isa 39:8 = 2Kin 20:19 3 t., compare Zech 8:19 ; שׁ ׳עֵת Eccl 3:8 ; ׳בְּשׁ 1Kin 2:5 in time of peace ; שׁ ׳שַׂר Isa 9:5 (Messianic title), compare שׁ ׳זֶה Micah 5:4 . 7 as adjective שְׁמָֹיו Psa 55:21 those at peace with him (read שֹׁלְמָיו Bae Buhl Du, or שְׁלֵטָיו SS; ᵐ5 apparently שִׁלּוּמָיו ).","rootNote":"or שָׁלֹם ; from 7999 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 12 18","keyReferences":["1Chr 12 18","1Chr 12 19","1Chr 12 19","1Chr 12 19","1Chr 18 10","1Chr 22 9","1Kgs 2 5","1Kgs 2 6"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":237,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 12 18","book":"1Chr","chapter":12,"verse":18,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לְ/שָׁל֞וֹם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"1Chr 12 19","book":"1Chr","chapter":12,"verse":19,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"שָׁל֨וֹם","source":"hebrew","mo